msgctxt "766"
msgid "Thank you. Your total comes to %s."
msgstr "Gracias. El precio total es de %s."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "801"
msgid "(I can't eat anymore...)"
msgstr "(No puedo comer más...)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=sasha
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "849"
msgid "As advertised, this meal comes with succulent, \ntender beef and miso soup."
msgstr "Fiel a su reputación, este plato incluye carne\njugosa y tierna, y sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=sasha
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "924"
msgid "As advertised, this large meal comes with succulent, \ntender beef and miso soup."
msgstr "Fiel a su reputación, este plato grande incluye carne\njugosa y tierna, y sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "1005"
msgid "A new menu item, but we make sure to keep that \nclassic pork flavor. Comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Un nuevo elemento en el menú, pero nos aseguramos\nde conservar ese distintivo sabor a cerdo.\nViene acompañado con sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "1096"
msgid "A new menu item, but we make sure to keep that classic pork  \nflavor. Comes with miso soup. Now with extra rice and extra pork!"
msgstr "Un nuevo elemento de menú, pero nos aseguramos de mantener ese clásico sabor de cerdo.\nViene con sopa de miso. ¡Ahora con arroz y carne de cerdo extra!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "1224"
msgid "A bowl of spicy bibimbap. Comes with a salty sweet \nKorean sauce called gochujang and miso soup on the\nside."
msgstr "Un cuenco de bibimbap picante. Viene con una salsa \ncoreana salada y dulce llamada \"gochujang\" y sopa de\nmiso en el costado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "1333"
msgid "A large bowl of spicy bibimbap. Comes with a salty \nsweet Korean sauce called gochujang and miso soup\non the side."
msgstr "Un gran cuenco de bibimbap picante. Viene con una salsa\ncoreana salada y dulce llamada \"gochujang\" y sopa de miso \nal costado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=sasha
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "1448"
msgid "As advertised, this meal is made with substantial \nchunks of tasty meat with miso soup on the side."
msgstr "Tal como se promociona, este plato se prepara con sustanciosos\ntrozos de deliciosa carne y sopa de miso al costado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=sasha
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "1548"
msgid "As advertised, this large meal is made with \nsubstantial chunks of tasty meat with miso soup on\nthe side."
msgstr "Tal como se promociona, este plato grande se prepara con\nsustanciosos trozos de deliciosa carne y sopa de miso \nal costado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "1654"
msgid "A popular menu item, with tender chunks of beef \nand curry on one plate. Comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Un elemento popular del menú, con trozos suaves\nde carne y curry en un plato. Viene con sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=sasha
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "1749"
msgid "An especially popular choice. Juicy BBQ kalbi beef \ntopped with kimchi on rice. Comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Una opción especialmente popular. Jugosa carne de\nres Kalbi a la barbacoa cubierta con kimchi sobre arroz.\nViene con sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "1851"
msgid "This is an extra large helping of our popular Kimchi &\nKalbi set. Juicy BBQ kalbi beef topped with kimchi on\nrice. Comes with miso soup."
msgstr "Este es un trozo extra grande de nuestro popular Kimchi &\nKalbi. Jugosa carne de res Kalbi a la barbacoa cubierta\ncon kimchi en arroz. Viene con sopa de miso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "1988"
msgid "One of our popular standard entrées on the menu.\nJuicy BBQ beef with rice, miso soup, and vegetables."
msgstr "Uno de nuestras populares entradas estándar en el menú.\nCarne jugosa a la barbacoa con arroz, sopa de miso y verduras."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "2091"
msgid "This popular set is made with juicy BBQ rib meat and\ntasty sauce. Comes with rice, miso soup, and\nvegetables."
msgstr "Este popular conjunto está hecho con jugosa carne de\ncostilla a la barbacoa y sabrosa salsa. Viene con arroz,\nsopa de miso y verduras."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "2201"
msgid "A hot, juicy hamburg steak topped with egg and sweet\ndemiglace sauce. Served with rice, miso soup, and\nvegetables."
msgstr "Un jugoso y caliente filete de hamburguesa cubierto con\nhuevo y salsa demi-glace dulce. Servido con arroz, sopa\nde miso y verduras."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "2316"
msgid "Stuffed with great-tasting pork for high stamina.\nIncludes rice, miso soup, fresh vegetables, and\ngrated daikon."
msgstr "Relleno de carne de cerdo deliciosa para una gran resistencia.\nIncluye arroz, sopa de miso, verduras frescas y \ndaikon rallado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=sasha
msgctxt "2429"
msgid "Comes with plenty of succulent pork, white rice, \nmiso soup, and vegetables."
msgstr "Viene con abundante y suculento cerdo, arroz blanco,\nsopa de miso y verduras."

